WEBVTT

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:08.584
At the top, Tries is how many wrong or missing keys a caller is allowed.

00:00:08.584 --> 00:00:12.920
A wrong key, no key, or Repeat this menu each use one try.

00:00:13.684 --> 00:00:18.493
When the tries run out, the default is Route to the entry point target.

00:00:18.493 --> 00:00:23.864
You can send the caller to a queue, an agent, voicemail or another menu instead.

00:00:46.386 --> 00:00:50.896
The builder counts the problems it finds, and the entry point does not

00:00:50.896 --> 00:00:52.795
save until they are fixed.

00:00:52.795 --> 00:00:56.711
A menu needs a prompt and at least one key, and queue, agent

00:00:56.711 --> 00:00:58.966
and transfer keys need a target.

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:00.467
Click Save.

00:01:00.467 --> 00:01:05.520
Callers hear the menu straight away, and only while the entry point is open.

